{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/741085-odd-influences-and-how-they-work","id":741085,"title":"Odd Influences and how they work.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-30T00:33:31-07:00","id":741085,"title":"Odd Influences and how they work.","content":"So... I've created a Murder spirit called &quot;Ushuru, the Deluge&quot; which manifests as 21 gallons of blood that splashes, sloshes, coats, and soak through its environment. The spirit is a very quickly growing Hursah who possesses Influences over Murder (2) and Blood (1<br /> <br /> Now, I know how it can strengthen and Manipulate Murder (violently <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />) but how does one <i>strengthen</i> blood? does a stain grow? does dried blood become fresh? will people bleed out or heal?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T03:46:24-07:00","id":741255,"title":"","content":"You could make people bleed out from small cuts, or strengthen the blood's viscosity to induce blood clots, or maybe even increase the volume of blood in someone and make them pop like a balloon. Although I'm not too sure about that last one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T05:00:06-07:00","id":741365,"title":"","content":"I think with Strengthening Blood you'd just be able to cause minor headaches, dizziness and swelling or aching, not real damage, or alternatively let people low on blood survive well off the blood they do have, possibly affecting the wound penalties if they're based on bloodlack. Yes, you could probably turn a stain from some minor speck to something larger and more concentrated that could be tasted by all. I wouldn't really let it become fresh, that's more of a Manipulate thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T10:34:47-07:00","id":742189,"title":"","content":"Watch some Tarantino films.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T10:43:40-07:00","id":742210,"title":"","content":"I figure you could also empower things that have blood, or that draw blood (like, say, needles, vampires).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T11:48:20-07:00","id":742392,"title":"","content":"thanks all.... Though I don't see how Strengthening blood would cause people to watch Tarantino films...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T11:53:22-07:00","id":742417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gnomish American</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/741085-odd-influences-and-how-they-work?p=742392#post742392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">thanks all.... Though I don't see how Strengthening blood would cause people to watch Tarantino films...</div> </div> </div> </div>He means that Tarantion movies are hyper bloody, and blood needlessly pop-up, like from fountains in them. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T12:24:40-07:00","id":742481,"title":"","content":"Think of it metaphorically for a minute.<br /> <br /> Strengthening blood makes things <i>bloodier</i>. Stains spread, blood always leaves stains, and blood becomes generally more noticeable. Under the influence, you'd never be able to pass off a blood-stain as a wine-stain, wounds bleed more freely, and even the lightest cut will drool and drip blood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T12:44:33-07:00","id":742510,"title":"","content":"As well as the points above, one could also say strengthening blood also means manipulating the pressure or flow of it in the human body. For example, manipulating the pressure of blood until someone has a fatal stroke, or increasing the blood pressure rapidly, then dropping it to dangerous levels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T12:55:50-07:00","id":742593,"title":"","content":"Possibilities for Strengthening the Influence of Blood, depending on the particular nature of the spirit in question:<br /> - Increasing the rate of bleeding. A target of Strengthening bleeds out at twice the usual speed.<br /> - Slowing the rate of bleeding by making the blood perform its natural role (clotting etc) faster. A target of Strengthening stops bleeding out immediately.<br /> - Increasing the evidence of blood. Bloodstains become great gory splatters, a trickle of droplets becomes a stream of the stuff, it comes oozing out of containers and vials and blood packs, all sticky and thick.<br /> - Increasing the benefit that certain haemophages gain when drinking a victim's blood.<br /> - Increasing the health of a subject as their blood seems to flow faster, carry more oxygen and nutrients and fill them with life; skin gets ruddier, blood vessels pump with greater pressure. The subject gets a dot of Fast Reflexes and Iron Stamina but it's probably not healthy to be subjected to this for long periods at a time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T13:27:49-07:00","id":742678,"title":"","content":"There's a Bleeding condition in the upcoming Hurt Locker book, you might be able to turn a normal wound into that. You can see it in the open development texts somewhere on the blog.<br /> <br /> We're probably going to houserule it so it becomes part of the standard Weaken the Prey conditions from urshul.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-30-2015, 04:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T22:47:00-07:00","id":743883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/741085-odd-influences-and-how-they-work?p=742417#post742417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He means that Tarantion movies are hyper bloody, and blood needlessly pop-up, like from fountains in them. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I know, Hamster, I was being &quot;funny&quot;.<br /> <br /> Thanks all, You've been a LOT of help.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":256,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","user":"Gnomish American","date":". 10-31-2015, 01:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-02T11:04:16-08:00","id":749492,"title":"","content":"With Influence Blood 3, this spirit might control bloodflow in unnatural ways, such as causing the failure of a specific organ by temporarily redirecting the blood inside into some sort of fleshy, transparent sav with no function. Taking blood from the brain might cause the Insensate Tilt, while messing around with the kidneys might result in a toxic build up represented by the Poisoned Tilt. This would allow for several other effects, so you could balance it by limiting how many types of Tilts the spirit can inflict to its dots in Influence Blood. Regardless, I'd say that the spirit shouldn't spend these Tilt slots on Arm Wrack, Leg Wrack, Blinded or Stunned, since those Tilts can be inflicted with the spirit's melee attacks (and the Bleeding Tilt might be worsened or stopped with 1 dot in the Influence, as mentioned before). Since ephemeral beings that Materialize don't really have internal organs, I'd say this Influence does not work on them. On the other hand, a snake-like spirit with Influence Plague 3 might be more restricted in what it can do, but it could affect other ephemeral entities because its plagues are more metaphysical than chemical. That way, Influence Blood is not better in every aspect to other Influences that affect the body. The Power + Finesse roll should definitely be contested by Stamina + Supernatural Tolerance, with dots in the Hardy and Iron Stamina Merits applying as bonus dice if you want. The biology here doesn't have to be 100% realistic, of course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 11-02-2015, 02:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}